Z||000000||mr2maniac||11-30-2000||04:29 PM||||Hi all!!  After all the hub-bub on the mr2 boards, I wanted to say HI, and post here.  I don't a thing about Fieros, not eve who makes them, so fill me with info if you can!!!||||reg||1
Z||000001||DaRkLoRD||11-30-2000||05:20 PM||||hey.. welcome to the forum.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>well, for starters.. the Fiero was made by Pontiac. There are quite a few similarities between Fieros and MR2s, they're both mid-engined 2 seater sports cars.. the fiero uses a steel space frame with bolt on plastic body panels, which makes it quite safe, as well as eliminating the problem of body rust. The fiero has several basic models, but the 2 biggest differences besides the body styling, is the engines. there's a 2.5L 4cyl version, and and 2.8L V6..<P>I'm sure some of the other people here can and will add a lot of basic fiero facts to what I've said.. but that's a start.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
Z||000002||sqoach||11-30-2000||05:27 PM||||simularities? i'll show you some simularities.  check this mr2 and fiero.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blackmr2.JPG"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blackfiero.JPG"> <P>i had to post 'em.  i think it's cool.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>sQoaCh<p>[This message has been edited by sqoach (edited 11-30-2000).]||||reg||10
Z||000003||2xsess||11-30-2000||05:28 PM||||<B>Welcome to the Forum</B> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Here's some basic Fiero info:<BR>Manufacturer: Pontiac<BR>Production years:1984-88<BR>Engine options: 2.5 TBI Iron Duke in the coupes, 87-88 coupes had a distributorless ignition.<BR>The GTs and SEs had the 2.8 MPI V6 in them.<BR>I know someone has all the numbers as far as the powerplant goes,i.e., hp and torque.<P>84-early86 the tranny options were the automatic and the 4spd manual tranny, in mid 86 the 5spd became available.<BR>Body wise, the coupes are what we refer to as the notchback.This is an 85GT<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sweetass_85GT_3.jpg">   In 86 the GT body style changed alot, we call them the Fastback model.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SideMcGT.JPG">  <BR>There,that should start you off   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><p>[This message has been edited by 2xsess (edited 11-30-2000).]||||reg||1
